---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Site active="wages-and-benefits">
  <section class="hero-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr); align-items: stretch; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: linear-gradient(rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.09), rgb(255, 255, 255));">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(46px, 6vw, 86px) 24px;">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 860px;">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">Wages &amp; benefits</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(33px, 4.3vw, 48px); line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.036em; color: var(--clairo-navy); max-width: 22ch;">When we build our model, caregiver wages come first — not last.</h1>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 18.5px; line-height: 29px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--clairo-blue); max-width: 48ch;">Caregiver pay is not a line item at the end of the budget. It is the starting point.</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 54ch;">Clairo Care is designed to run lean so more of the available service funding reaches the people actually providing support. Better pay is how a participant keeps the caregiver they trust.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
          <a href="/caregivers"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">For caregivers</Button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="wages" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px);">
      <div style="background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 54px); position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="position: absolute; right: -68px; top: -70px; width: 230px; height: 230px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(92, 182, 242, 0.09);"></div>
        <div style="position: relative;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">More for the people providing care</p>
          <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.6vw, 40px); line-height: 1.13; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 22ch;">What Clairo pays.</h2>
          <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 69ch;">These are the figures in our current materials. We publish them because families and caregivers deserve to know the numbers before they start a conversation.</p>
          <div class="four-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin-top: 34px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); overflow: hidden;">
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Hourly Rate</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">$31.50–$51/hr</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Base hourly range</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Mileage Reimbursement</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4 miles per hour worked</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Reimbursed per shift</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Health Benefits</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Health Insurance &amp; PTO</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">For eligible caregivers</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Quarterly Wellness</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Whatever restores you!</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">A quarterly wellness benefit</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/wages-and-benefits"><Button>See full wages &amp; benefits →</Button></a>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 18px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 66ch;">*Wages vary by service, participant circumstances, available service funding, employee eligibility, and other applicable factors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Caregiver pay is care quality</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Compensation is the most direct lever on quality of care.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 64ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">This is not an abstract value. Every one of these follows from what caregivers are paid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Retention</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Caregivers who are paid well stay in the role, and the participant keeps the person who knows them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Recruiting</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Competitive pay widens the pool of people willing to take on demanding, skilled work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Continuity</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Fewer handovers means fewer disruptions to routines, communication, and trust.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Relationships</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Long tenure is what turns a caregiver into someone who genuinely understands the participant.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Quality of care</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Experienced, stable caregivers notice changes earlier and support goals better.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 26px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Family peace of mind</p>
          <p style="margin: 9px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Families spend less time recruiting and re-training, and more time living their lives.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell two-col" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">How the model works</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Low overhead, on purpose.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body">Every provider agency has real costs — payroll, compliance, training, billing, coordination. Clairo built its own software so those functions take fewer people and less time, and structured the organization to stay lean.</p>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="margin-top: 10px;">That structure is the whole point: the less the model costs to run, the more of the service rate can go toward caregiver compensation. It is a choice about priorities, not a criticism of anyone else's.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; margin-top: 22px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Purpose-built tools instead of manual administration</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">A lean organization with fewer layers</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Compensation treated as a first commitment, not a leftover</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Transparency about what we pay</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 32px; background: var(--background);">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-blue);">Beyond the hourly rate</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Mileage</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">Reimbursed for eligible travel</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Health benefits</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">Available for eligible caregivers</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Paid time off</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">Available for eligible caregivers</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Training</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">Required certifications supported and tracked</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Support</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">A named coordinator, not a call queue</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 14px 0px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;">
            <span style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Flexibility</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: right; max-width: 26ch;">Schedules built around the participant</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px);">
      <div class="two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 30px;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow">If you're a family</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Wages are how you keep the caregiver you found.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Ask us what a caregiver supporting your participant could be paid for the services in their plan, and what that means for continuity.</p>
          <a href="/contact" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">Talk to Clairo →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 30px;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow">If you're a caregiver</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Do meaningful work — and be valued for it.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">See what Clairo offers caregivers, including mileage, benefits for eligible employees, training, and real support.</p>
          <a href="/caregivers" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">Caregiver information →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 24px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 100ch;">Wages vary by service, participant circumstances, available service funding, employee eligibility, and other applicable factors. Community Development Services wages depend on the funding allocated to that service in the participant's budget. Benefits and paid time off are available to eligible employees under the applicable plan terms. Clairo cannot guarantee any particular wage for any individual caregiver.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px) 24px 30px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div style="max-width: 1104px; margin: 0px auto; background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Let's talk</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.14; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Want the numbers for your situation?</h2>
        <p style="margin: 14px 0px 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Wages depend on the service, the plan, and available funding. Tell us about the participant and we'll walk through what applies.</p>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">No pressure. Just a conversation about your options.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  </Site>
